# Desktop web Design editor

Separate product surface from the iPhone Design / quick-edit system. Do **not** change `WebViewPreview.swift`, Design Swift views, or iOS quick-edit to “make web work.”

## Isolation
- Shell: `web/marketing/design.html` + `design-app.js` + `design.css`
- Bridge: `web/js/design-bridge.js` — only arms when framed with `?bk_design=1` / Design shell parent messages
- Dormant for normal visitors and the iOS WKWebView
- Build on `feature/web-design-editor` until ready to merge/deploy
- Shop Website opens full-screen `/design` (same tab, same auth). **Done** (mark) returns to `/app`. Canvas is the live tenant template — not a fake builder site.

## Preview is a canvas, not a website
- In Design mode the iframe must **not** navigate, submit forms, open drawers/lightboxes, or run booking/shop flows
- Block `a[href]` clicks, form submit, `location.assign` / `replace`, `window.open`, `history.pushState` / `replaceState`
- Pointer-events off for site chrome (links, forms, inputs, sidebar); on only for editable text, photos, and color bands
- Brand / CTA links that wrap `data-edit-key` (e.g. Luxe site name → `/home`) open inline edit — never follow the href
- Page changes only via the Design shell left rail (Home / Book / …), not by clicking the site

## Interaction (Squarespace-simple)
- **Text:** single click → type in place (`contenteditable`). Clicks inside the active field must not restart edit. Place caret after focus.
- **Photos:** double-click or inspector → upload/crop
- **Colors:** click band → inspector (role-level in v1; independent `webSurfaceColors` later)
- Escape: blur/commit if editing, else deselect
- Commit text on blur; ⌘/Ctrl+S saves pending; Enter allows newlines in multi-line

## Outline policy
- Dashed outline **only** if the web editor can save the field
- No outline for unsupported keys (`svc:`, `s12Process:`, `charterFaq:`, `tm:`, `*:edit`) — edit those in the iPhone app for now
- Selection chrome follows the active target; inspector mirrors selection

## Copy vs identity
- Website Design may write **website copy** only (`webCopyOverrides` / `wc.*`)
- Site name keys (`displayName`, `displayName.*`) → `wc.site.displayName` — never tenant identity `displayName` / businessName
- Allowed direct site text fields are the theme optional fields + about/tagline/contact (see `SITE_TEXT_FIELDS` in `design-app.js`)
- Show override when set; otherwise fall back to identity for display

## Paint (when expanding)
- Follow `edit-template` card/chrome independence
- Edit/design mode must not restamp keyed fills, CTA fills, or text
- Classic / Blade / Luxe / Stonecut / Studio 12 keyed paint stays frozen unless asked to reopen; Charter keyed paint is live

## Preview / save
- Inline typing updates the iframe immediately; inspector `input` patches via `text-patch`
- Do not full-reload the preview on every keystroke
- Save persists `state.pending` to the tenant doc
